      "fields": {
        "heading": "Welcome to Abundance",
        "body": "We’re glad you’ve joined us. You’re one of a growing number of people who want their money to be doing more.\n\nOur investments bring councils and citizens together to build a more sustainable, resilient and thriving future for our places.\n\nNow you’ve made an account, it’s quick and easy to start building your municipal investment portfolio. If you have any questions, you'll find full information on our website, or you can speak to us."
      }
    },
